00:18:49.240 --> 00:18:50.980
especially because this isn't, I don't know,

00:18:50.980 --> 00:18:55.560
this isn't like volleyball where the ball is, like, high up in the air,

00:18:55.680 --> 00:18:57.180
and you wait for it to come back down,

00:18:57.220 --> 00:18:59.240
