00:19:16.860 --> 00:19:18.800
Yeah, and one thing I will note,

00:19:18.840 --> 00:19:22.100
just is just in sports games in general,

00:19:22.120 --> 00:19:28.120
where there is this ambiguity of who would be getting,

00:19:28.420 --> 00:19:30.160
